{"id":"npc:%E5%AE%89","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"丰川祥子首场梦境中以自己经历化身的小女孩，全名安娜。喜爱童话，将自己的生活反转后写成童话，与爱丽丝成为笔友。在即将成年之时祥子为其献上自己的钢琴曲。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情SS-1 花格窗边的梦想。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/4/4f/Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_661_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_01_beg","lineCount":28,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":226,"line":227,"speaker":"安","text":"……嗯。"},{"commandIndex":230,"line":231,"speaker":"安","text":"我尝试把自己经历的一切写下来，展现给他人看，可没有人想要看到压抑和绝望。"},{"commandIndex":316,"line":317,"speaker":"安","text":"……嗯！"}]}]}